# Normalize text files in the repo, and check out as LF everywhere.
# This repo is worked on from both native Windows and WSL (Spacemacs);
# without this, Windows' core.autocrlf=true would rewrite the Makefile
# and Clojure sources to CRLF on checkout, which GNU Make and some
# shell-invoked tooling do not tolerate, while WSL checkouts would stay
# LF -- silently diverging the two working trees. (Git operations on this
# repo are also required to happen from WSL only -- see AUTHORS-GUIDE.md
# "Git operations: WSL only" -- this is defense in depth, not a substitute
# for that rule.)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly declare text files so git's binary-detection heuristic never
# has to guess for the file types this repo actually contains.
*.md text
*.clj text eol=lf
*.edn text eol=lf
*.bib text
Makefile text eol=lf

# Binary files — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
